{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华指控以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要听耶和华的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂指控住在这片土地上的居民，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“这片土地上的人不忠不信，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫无良善，不认识上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们赌咒、撒谎、凶杀、偷窃、通奸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为所欲为，血案累累。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，这片土地要哀鸣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的居民都要消亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田间的野兽、空中的飞鸟、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水里的鱼类也要灭绝。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“谁都不要指控别人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁都不要责备别人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我要指控你们这些祭司。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们白天黑夜都要跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知也要跟你们一起跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要毁灭你们的母亲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民因无知而遭灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们拒绝认识我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要拒绝让你们做我的祭司；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们忘记你们上帝的律法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要忘记你们的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们祭司越增多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所犯的罪也越多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要使你们的尊荣变为羞耻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们祭司食用我子民的赎罪祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"满心希望他们犯罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将来，我的子民如何，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们祭司也如何。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要照你们的所作所为惩罚你们、报应你们，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们吃却不得饱足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行淫却不得后代","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们背弃耶和华，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沉溺酒色，丧失心智。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“我的子民祈求木头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"随从木杖的指引。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淫乱的心使他们走入歧途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不忠不贞，背弃他们的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在山顶和高岗上的橡树、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杨树和栗树下献祭烧香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为树荫怡人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“所以，你们的女儿淫乱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的儿媳通奸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我不会因此而惩罚她们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们也与娼妓苟合，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与庙妓一起献祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无知的民族必走向灭亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“虽然以色列如同妓女，对我不忠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不要使犹大犯罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要到吉甲去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要到伯·亚文","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要凭永活的耶和华起誓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列桀骜不驯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同桀骜不驯的母牛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华怎能牧养他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同在草场上牧养羊羔呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"与偶像为伍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任由他吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们酒足兴尽之后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便不住地行淫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的首领恋慕羞耻之事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"风要把他们卷走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必因所献的祭而蒙羞。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"“行淫却不得后代”此处的意思是指责以色列人祭拜迦南人掌管生育的神明。他们以为这样能带来更多后代。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":10}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"“伯·亚文”意思是“罪恶之家”，在此指伯特利。“伯特利”意思是“上帝之家”，但当时已变成祭拜偶像之地。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":15}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"“以法莲”为北国以色列最大的支派，圣经中有时用来代指北国以色列。本卷书中下同。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}